{"src":"uk","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":187300,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"uk","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":12529.924079999999,"text":"Якщо ви дивилися фільм «Скарб нації», ви можете подумати, що карта скарбів була написана на зворотному боці Декларації Незалежності."},{"kind":"text","t":13371.74481,"text":"If you’ve watched the movie “National Treasure,” you might think the treasure map was written on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"audio","t":13469.956054,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13474.823204,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13480.434642,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13485.808643999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13491.243935,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13496.621678,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":13497.063769999999,"samples":9792,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":18631.519867,"text":"Цей гарячий шоколад задовольняє вимогам бельгійських стандартів."},{"kind":"text","t":18920.383362,"text":"This hot chocolate meets Belgian standards."},{"kind":"audio","t":19010.591376,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19015.931979,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19017.971204999998,"samples":16664,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":150},{"kind":"input","t":23903.794428,"text":"А фруктові соки коштують зовсім не дешево, але вони прекрасні."},{"kind":"text","t":24373.305528,"text":"And fruit juices aren’t cheap at all, but they’re wonderful."},{"kind":"audio","t":24465.808355,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":24470.904172,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":24475.487407,"samples":31064,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":720},{"kind":"input","t":33583.050666,"text":"Однак це неправда. Незважаючи на те, що на зворотньому боці документа дійсно щось написано, це не мапа скарбів."},{"kind":"text","t":34340.282790000005,"text":"But that’s not true. Although there is indeed something written on the back of the document, it isn’t a treasure map."},{"kind":"audio","t":34432.275465000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34433.050242000005,"samples":16432,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":150},{"kind":"audio","t":34521.524115,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34526.807399000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34532.102772000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1070},{"kind":"audio","t":34537.459794,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":170,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":34538.79427300001,"samples":14128,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":30},{"kind":"input","t":40374.484149,"text":"Ви також можете захотіти проконсультуватися з урядами інших країн."},{"kind":"text","t":40791.278952,"text":"You may also want to consult the governments of other countries."},{"kind":"audio","t":40883.799088,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":40889.265349,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":40894.808928000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1090},{"kind":"audio","t":40895.080554,"samples":7296,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":45399.185291,"text":"окрім вашої, але їхні поради розробили для їхнього."},{"kind":"text","t":45788.509162,"text":"Besides yours, but their advice was developed for theirs."},{"kind":"audio","t":45876.825978,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45881.943824,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45887.526313,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1100},{"kind":"audio","t":45887.877017000006,"samples":6696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":53725.931191,"text":"Острів Гонконг надає територію Гонконгу, свою назву і є місцем, на яке звертають особливу увагу багато туристів."},{"kind":"text","t":54457.338048000005,"text":"Hong Kong Island provides the territory of Hong Kong with its name and is a place that attracts special attention from many tourists."},{"kind":"audio","t":54564.12332100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54569.771118000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54575.467955,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54580.936266000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54586.305678000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54591.796968,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54596.187376,"samples":32592,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":810},{"kind":"input","t":64716.094236000004,"text":"Кожен, хто планує їхати за кермом у високих широтах або через гірські перевали, має брати до уваги можливість снігу, льоду або мінусових температур."},{"kind":"text","t":65525.011795,"text":"Anyone planning to drive in high latitudes or through mountain passes should consider the possibility of snow, ice, or sub-zero temperatures."},{"kind":"audio","t":65636.463632,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":65641.635337,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":65646.914821,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":65652.126536,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":65657.702085,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":65663.200325,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":65668.579067,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":65669.60734,"samples":17224,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":130},{"kind":"input","t":71728.32851800001,"text":"Сегреграція та рекомбінація змінюють варіацію між двома резервами з кожним поколінням."},{"kind":"text","t":72265.977654,"text":"Segregation and recombination alter the variation between the two pools with each generation."},{"kind":"audio","t":72367.434504,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":72372.56845,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":72378.018901,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":160,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":72383.542351,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":72389.07882000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1130},{"kind":"audio","t":72389.72690000001,"samples":10160,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":77945.525884,"text":"З формальної точки зору ентомологи описують цю групу комах терміном жук."},{"kind":"text","t":78457.220984,"text":"Formally, entomologists describe this group of insects as beetles."},{"kind":"audio","t":78547.48592800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78549.251879,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78551.128748,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78551.805857,"samples":22896,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":370},{"kind":"input","t":86956.501743,"text":"По-перше, більшість вершників носять чоботи для верхової їзди з підборами та гладкою, досить вузькою підошвою."},{"kind":"text","t":87505.371645,"text":"First, most riders wear riding boots with heels and a smooth, fairly narrow sole."},{"kind":"audio","t":87599.372497,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87604.759969,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87610.115462,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87615.453534,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":87616.912861,"samples":14128,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":95579.683815,"text":"Комісія стала відповіддю Мартеллі на масштабні протести проти режиму, які розпочались у жовтні."},{"kind":"text","t":96210.64690400001,"text":"The commission was Martelli’s response to the large-scale protests against the regime that began in October."},{"kind":"audio","t":96315.176104,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96320.381829,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96325.913879,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96331.047515,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96336.529505,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96339.218651,"samples":20960,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":240},{"kind":"input","t":101931.784604,"text":"Пожежні та рятувальні бригади зрештою погасили вогонь о 23.35."},{"kind":"text","t":102535.911212,"text":"Fire and rescue teams finally extinguished the fire at 11:35 p.m."},{"kind":"audio","t":102625.640575,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":102630.931738,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":102636.482357,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":102642.015587,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":102644.01343400001,"samples":17728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":70},{"kind":"input","t":108520.11155,"text":"Сьогодні в Атлантичному океані сформувався субтропічний ураган Джері."},{"kind":"text","t":108926.408104,"text":"Tropical Storm Jerry formed in the Atlantic Ocean today."},{"kind":"audio","t":109014.722999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":109019.888435,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":109025.59779100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":109025.92377600001,"samples":8496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":113589.95500300001,"text":"Десятий ураган сезону Атлантичних ураганів, який отримав назву."},{"kind":"text","t":113952.796768,"text":"The tenth named hurricane of the Atlantic hurricane season."},{"kind":"audio","t":114047.721735,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114052.987749,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":114058.81248400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1060},{"kind":"audio","t":114059.04981,"samples":7896,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":120919.740261,"text":"Воно подарувало нам потяги, автомобілі та багато інших транспортних засобів."},{"kind":"text","t":121346.714207,"text":"It gave us trains, cars, and many other vehicles."},{"kind":"audio","t":121438.001753,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121443.244218,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121447.607346,"samples":29864,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":690},{"kind":"input","t":128133.437242,"text":"Він відомий тим, що був епіцентром роскоші, початок якого датується приблизно..."},{"kind":"text","t":128705.5309,"text":"It is known as the epicenter of luxury, with its origins dating back to around..."},{"kind":"audio","t":128801.215544,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128802.429924,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128803.837121,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128805.704631,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":128806.151444,"samples":16528,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":60},{"kind":"input","t":136048.01559999998,"text":"400 роком нашої ери, та який проіснував приблизно до 1100 року нашої ери."},{"kind":"text","t":136598.905046,"text":"400 AD, and it existed until around 1100 AD."},{"kind":"audio","t":136694.19986599998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136699.44277999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136705.025469,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136710.56756899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":136710.88447299998,"samples":6928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":143664.28055999998,"text":"Поверхня місяця складається з каміння та пилу. Верхній шар місяця називається корот."},{"kind":"text","t":144202.64548099999,"text":"The surface of the moon is made up of rocks and dust. The upper layer of the moon is called the crust."},{"kind":"audio","t":144301.378975,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144306.63655899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144310.976168,"samples":29264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":620},{"kind":"audio","t":144388.764145,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144394.232536,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144396.22468299998,"samples":17264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":180},{"kind":"input","t":153983.959033,"text":"За оцінками інженерних військ США, 6 дюймів дощових опадів можуть прорвати раніше пошкоджені дами."},{"kind":"text","t":154666.063321,"text":"According to the U.S. Army Corps of Engineers, 6 inches of rainfall could overwhelm previously damaged dams."},{"kind":"audio","t":154770.65118999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154776.10181999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154781.35579499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154786.94012299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154791.31758099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154793.13410199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":960},{"kind":"audio","t":154793.42352699998,"samples":3792,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":162584.66114399998,"text":"Зокрема, стверджують, що можливо визначити, чи бреше людина за допомогою правильної інтерпретації мікровиразів."},{"kind":"text","t":163361.056789,"text":"In particular, it is claimed that it is possible to determine whether a person is lying through proper interpretation of microexpressions."},{"kind":"audio","t":163460.34122499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":163465.48014099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":290,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163470.99988999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163476.443511,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163481.847563,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":163487.317043,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163490.90747399998,"samples":25992,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":500},{"kind":"input","t":168716.69102199998,"text":"Не поплюжте місце нанесенням відмітин або графіті на споруди."},{"kind":"text","t":169213.187117,"text":"Do not deface the area by leaving marks or graffiti on the structures."},{"kind":"audio","t":169310.719891,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":169315.713509,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":169321.303208,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":169325.283683,"samples":27696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":580},{"kind":"input","t":176220.245016,"text":"Ричання тигра не схожі на повноголосне ричання лева, скоріше на плутані вигу."},{"kind":"text","t":177030.41735799998,"text":"A tiger’s roar isn’t like a lion’s full-throated roar; rather, it’s more like confused growls."},{"kind":"audio","t":177124.310092,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":177129.669004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":177133.720348,"samples":28664,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":560},{"kind":"audio","t":177208.127541,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":177213.56905199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":177214.090543,"samples":10664,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":186857.561581,"text":"Проведене у ХХ столітті дослідження показало, що існують дві групи генотипної мінливості – прихована та висока."},{"kind":"text","t":187663.756818,"text":"A study conducted in the 20th century showed that there are two groups of genotypic variation—hidden and high."},{"kind":"audio","t":187768.260838,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":187773.58859099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":187778.781326,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":187784.165498,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":187789.772126,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":187794.45674,"samples":30560,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":620},{"kind":"close","t":197806.582485,"code":1005}]}